{"annotation_scheme": "UD-FSL-STK-FORM", "document": "LS-Colin_champignon", "french_text": "J'avais oublié: il faut ajouter deux gousses d'ail, bien écrasées et les mettre dans la poêle avec deux cuillerées d'huile.", "gloss_sequence": "[A]-[I]-[L] SST[gousse] [OUBLIER] [AJOUTER] [DEUX] [gousse] [gousse] [ÉCRASER] [METTRE] [POÊLE] [DEUX] [CUILLÈRE] [HUILE/SAUCE] [verser-HUILE]", "language_variant": "LSF_FR", "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "linguistic_review": "PENDING_LOCAL_REVIEW", "pair_id": "stk:LS-Colin_champignon__17", "quality_flags": ["FREE_TRANSLATION", "UD_PARALLEL_NO", "NONMANUALS_NOT_IN_TARGET"], "recording": "https://cocoon.huma-num.fr/data/cuxac/CUC022_low.mp4", "rights_status": "LICENSED_RESEARCH", "source_annotation": "PUBLISHED_EXPERT_ANNOTATION", "source_id": "stk", "source_revision": "d1a6c6487eeddf67a14a5e61116b7cc12a0d1f6a", "source_segment_ids": ["LS-Colin_champignon__17"], "speaker_group": "LS-Colin_champignon:UNKNOWN", "split": "train", "split_group": "component:2621feb3ef63afcb"}
{"annotation_scheme": "UD-FSL-STK-FORM", "document": "LS-Colin_champignon", "french_text": "Laisser frire jusqu'à ce que cela devienne marron.", "gloss_sequence": "[LAISSER] [FRIRE] [JUSQUE]~ [DEVENIR] [COMMENCER] [MARRON]", "language_variant": "LSF_FR", "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "linguistic_review": "PENDING_LOCAL_REVIEW", "pair_id": "stk:LS-Colin_champignon__18", "quality_flags": ["FREE_TRANSLATION", "UD_PARALLEL_NO", "NONMANUALS_NOT_IN_TARGET"], "recording": "https://cocoon.huma-num.fr/data/cuxac/CUC022_low.mp4", "rights_status": "LICENSED_RESEARCH", "source_annotation": "PUBLISHED_EXPERT_ANNOTATION", "source_id": "stk", "source_revision": "d1a6c6487eeddf67a14a5e61116b7cc12a0d1f6a", "source_segment_ids": ["LS-Colin_champignon__18"], "speaker_group": "LS-Colin_champignon:UNKNOWN", "split": "train", "split_group": "component:2621feb3ef63afcb"}
