{"annotation_scheme": "UD-FSL-STK-FORM", "document": "LS-Colin_champignon", "french_text": "Dans un petit récipient, verser trois cuillères de sauce soja (un peu visqueux),", "gloss_sequence": "[petit-récipient] [S]-[O]-[J]-[A] [SAUCE] [visqueux] [verser-SAUCE] [TROIS] [verser]", "language_variant": "LSF_FR", "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "linguistic_review": "PENDING_LOCAL_REVIEW", "pair_id": "stk:LS-Colin_champignon__21", "quality_flags": ["FREE_TRANSLATION", "UD_PARALLEL_NO", "NONMANUALS_NOT_IN_TARGET"], "recording": "https://cocoon.huma-num.fr/data/cuxac/CUC022_low.mp4", "rights_status": "LICENSED_RESEARCH", "source_annotation": "PUBLISHED_EXPERT_ANNOTATION", "source_id": "stk", "source_revision": "d1a6c6487eeddf67a14a5e61116b7cc12a0d1f6a", "source_segment_ids": ["LS-Colin_champignon__21"], "speaker_group": "LS-Colin_champignon:UNKNOWN", "split": "train", "split_group": "component:2621feb3ef63afcb"}
{"annotation_scheme": "UD-FSL-STK-FORM", "document": "LS-Colin_champignon", "french_text": "Mettre le sucre, mettre le sel, ajouter le poivre, et mélanger. C'est tout.", "gloss_sequence": "[SUCRE] [METTRE] [SEL] [METTRE] [POIVRE] [METTRE] [mélanger] [FINI]~", "language_variant": "LSF_FR", "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "linguistic_review": "PENDING_LOCAL_REVIEW", "pair_id": "stk:LS-Colin_champignon__22", "quality_flags": ["FREE_TRANSLATION", "UD_PARALLEL_NO", "NONMANUALS_NOT_IN_TARGET"], "recording": "https://cocoon.huma-num.fr/data/cuxac/CUC022_low.mp4", "rights_status": "LICENSED_RESEARCH", "source_annotation": "PUBLISHED_EXPERT_ANNOTATION", "source_id": "stk", "source_revision": "d1a6c6487eeddf67a14a5e61116b7cc12a0d1f6a", "source_segment_ids": ["LS-Colin_champignon__22"], "speaker_group": "LS-Colin_champignon:UNKNOWN", "split": "train", "split_group": "component:2621feb3ef63afcb"}
{"annotation_scheme": "UD-FSL-STK-FORM", "document": "LS-Colin_champignon", "french_text": "Lorsque c'est à mi-cuisson, verser le bol de sauce dans la poëlle, laisser chauffer, mélanger et laisser jusqu'à ce que le liquide en surface soit un peu absorbé, il ne faut pas le laisser absorber entièrement.", "gloss_sequence": "[par-là]~ [VERSER] [mettre-SAUCE] [LAISSER] [CHAUFFER] [MÉLANGER] [LAISSER] [JUSQUE] [EAU] [en-surface] [ABSORBER-totalement] [NON] [ABSORBER-un-peu]~", "language_variant": "LSF_FR", "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "linguistic_review": "PENDING_LOCAL_REVIEW", "pair_id": "stk:LS-Colin_champignon__23", "quality_flags": ["FREE_TRANSLATION", "UD_PARALLEL_NO", "NONMANUALS_NOT_IN_TARGET"], "recording": "https://cocoon.huma-num.fr/data/cuxac/CUC022_low.mp4", "rights_status": "LICENSED_RESEARCH", "source_annotation": "PUBLISHED_EXPERT_ANNOTATION", "source_id": "stk", "source_revision": "d1a6c6487eeddf67a14a5e61116b7cc12a0d1f6a", "source_segment_ids": ["LS-Colin_champignon__23"], "speaker_group": "LS-Colin_champignon:UNKNOWN", "split": "train", "split_group": "component:2621feb3ef63afcb"}
{"annotation_scheme": "UD-FSL-STK-FORM", "document": "LS-Colin_champignon", "french_text": "Eteindre le feu et verser le contenu de la poêle dans un saladier.", "gloss_sequence": "[COUPER] [prendre-POÊLE] [verser] [forme-arrondie/saladier] [verser-dans-saladier]", "language_variant": "LSF_FR", "license_id": "CC-BY-SA-4.0", "linguistic_review": "PENDING_LOCAL_REVIEW", "pair_id": "stk:LS-Colin_champignon__24", "quality_flags": ["FREE_TRANSLATION", "UD_PARALLEL_NO", "NONMANUALS_NOT_IN_TARGET"], "recording": "https://cocoon.huma-num.fr/data/cuxac/CUC022_low.mp4", "rights_status": "LICENSED_RESEARCH", "source_annotation": "PUBLISHED_EXPERT_ANNOTATION", "source_id": "stk", "source_revision": "d1a6c6487eeddf67a14a5e61116b7cc12a0d1f6a", "source_segment_ids": ["LS-Colin_champignon__24"], "speaker_group": "LS-Colin_champignon:UNKNOWN", "split": "train", "split_group": "component:2621feb3ef63afcb"}
